VYNT is a gaming creator platform where users find opportunities, apply for programs, and create gaming content with AI.

VYNT is a gaming creator platform that connects users with gaming content opportunities and creator programs. Users can browse available opportunities, review requirements, submit applications, and participate in approved programs. The platform is designed to support creators who produce gaming content for platforms such as TikTok. VYNT uses AI-powered features to assist with creator workflows, content-related tasks, recommendations, and other platform functions. TikTok Login Kit is used to authenticate users and connect their TikTok account to their VYNT account when TikTok-related functionality is required. The scope of the product is limited to gaming creator opportunities, creator participation, content workflows, and related platform services. VYNT only requests the TikTok information and permissions necessary for the specific functionality being provided. Users can manage their participation through the VYNT website and can review the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy before using the service.

